})],\\quad b_{ji}=[x_{ji}\\ne0]","ascii":"y[i]=0 or 1 after booleanizing inputs by !=0; op is and, or, xor (odd parity), difference (first AND NOT every remaining input), or not (one input).","symbols":[{"id":"y","role":"output","binding":"wgsl:outputMask"}],"derivation":"curated"},{"id":"gpu-core.scan","tex":"\\term{y}{y_i}=\\left(\\sum_{j=s(i)}^{i-1+\\delta}\\term{x}{x_j}\\right)\\bmod 2^{32},\\quad s(i)=\\max(\\{0\\}\\cup\\{j\\le i:\\term{heads}{h_j}\\ne0\\})","ascii":"y[i] = sum(x[s(i)..i-1+delta]) mod 2^32; delta=0 exclusive (default), 1 inclusive; s(i) is the last nonzero segment flag or 0.","symbols":[{"id":"x","role":"input","binding":"wgsl:inputValues"},{"id":"y","role":"output","binding":"wgsl:outputValues"},{"id":"heads","role":"input","binding":"wgsl:segmentFlags"}],"derivation":"curated"},{"id":"gpu-core.reduction","tex":"\\term{y}{y}=\\operatorname{op}_{i\\in S}\\term{x}{x_i},\\quad S=\\{i:\\term{mask}{m_i}\\ne0\\},\\quad\\operatorname{op}\\in\\{\\operatorname{sum},\\operatorname{min},\\operatorname{max},\\operatorname{extent}\\}","ascii":"Reduce selected x by operation=sum|min|max|extent (min,max). Missing mask selects all. Min/max/extent ignore nonfinite f32; masked f32 sum also ignores them, unmasked sum does not. Empty/all-invalid min/max/extent and empty sum return 0. Integer sums wrap at 32 bits.","symbols":[{"id":"x","role":"input","binding":"wgsl:inputValues"},{"id":"y","role":"output","binding":"wgsl:outputValues"},{"id":"mask","role":"input","binding":"wgsl:inputValidity"}],"derivation":"curated"},{"id":"gpu-core.compaction","tex":"\\term{offsets}{o_i}=\\sum_{j<i}\\term{flags}{f_j}\\bmod2^{32},\\quad\\term{y}{y_{o_i}}=\\term{x}{x_i}\\ (f_i\\ne0),\\quad\\term{count}{c}=o_{n-1}+\\operatorname{min}(f_{n-1},1)","ascii":"o[i]=exclusive uint32 scan(flags); if flags[i]!=0 and o[i] is in output capacity, y[o[i]]=x[i]. count=(o[n-1]+min(flags[n-1],1)) mod 2^32, empty=0. Dense stable compaction requires binary flags; raw nonbinary flags leave gaps.","s